A type theory that integrates Hoare-style specifications into types, allowing pre/postconditions and invariants to be expressed and checked within a dependently typed language.

A ${fref("/01-programming-language-theory/02-concepts/type-theory.td")} that integrates ${fref("/01-programming-language-theory/02-concepts/hoare-logic.td")}-style specifications into types, allowing pre/postconditions and invariants to be expressed and checked within a dependently typed language.
